"body": "Today, some Wiz Defend customers saw Threats generated by two GitHub threat-detection rules due to a false-positive condition. We identified the root cause and fixed both rules. You can safely ignore these Threats and bulk-resolve them as false positives in the Wiz portal.\n\nAffected rules\nMass Clone Operations Of Private Repositories Performed By User\nRule ID: cer-github-data-massPrivateRepoCloneOperationsByUser\n\nMass Clone Operations Performed By User\nRule ID: cer-github-data-massCloneOperationsByUser\n\nNo other rules or services were impacted.",
